overed testing room  back up on the top deck can't drew  counts his blessings has there ever been  a positive kobe case  taught you what never  that perfect track record since june  30th means peace of mind for all  including me time for some fun  zipping down water slides and splashing  out at the end  dancing with the crew during an  oktoberfest party  brushing up on my bowling and losing to  the president with a contact high five  our crews coming back after one day and  two nights ending a bit too soon i  definitely do that again a quick  refreshing escape safe from kovitz  showing that even if you can't go  somewhere you can still go nowhere for  cbs saturday morning i'm raymie  innocencio in hong kong
 

